<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Physician Computer started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Physician Computer started.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rodman &amp; Renshaw analyst Amy Brodsky said she started coverage of Physician Computer Network Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the physician practice managemeny systems company were up 1/4 to 9-1/8.</p>
<p>--&quot;PCN's installed base of 95,000 physicians offer the opportunity for a large recurring revenue stream,&quot; Brodsky said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
